2026-07-27T11:40:33.7444063Z i /tmp/RtmpbEdiv0/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:40:33.7444437Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:40:33.7444866Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:40:33.7445234Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:40:33.7446112Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:40:33.7447470Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:40:33.7448402Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
